  "prefLabel": "Ins 801.07 Statistical Agents' Compliance with the Statistical Handbook",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 801.07 Statistical Agents' Compliance with the Statistical Handbook. For every line of insurance that it collects statistics in this state, every statistical agent shall, at a minimum, collect statistics and file reports and compilations in the form and detail provided in the NAIC Statistical Handbook, edition date 2012, as available in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #9053, eff 1-2-08; ss by #11008, eff 12-31-15; ss by #14505, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins800.html"
